00:26:51.040 --> 00:26:53.420
can help ensure that the language model's output

00:26:53.420 --> 00:26:56.220
is relevant, useful and consistent

00:26:56.220 --> 00:26:59.400
with the needs and preferences of the target audience,

00:26:59.400 --> 00:27:01.040
making it a powerful tool

00:27:01.040 --> 00:27:03.300
for developing effective language models

00:27:03.300 --> 00:27:05.500
