00:31:19.320 --> 00:31:21.640
in the prompt engineering.

00:31:21.640 --> 00:31:23.880
In this section, I'm going to talk about two types

00:31:23.880 --> 00:31:27.000
of prompting we can do, zero-shot prompting

00:31:27.000 --> 00:31:28.640
and few-shot prompting.

00:31:28.640 --> 00:31:31.640
Zero-shot prompting leverages a pre-trained model's

00:31:31.640 --> 00:31:34.380
understanding of words and concept relationships

00:31:34.380 --> 00:31:36.040
without further training.

00:31:36.040 --> 00:31:38.720
And few-shot prompting enhances the model

00:31:38.720 --> 00:31:42.920
with training examples via the prompt avoiding retraining.

00:31:42.920 --> 00:31:46.560
So essentially in the context of the GPT-4 model,

00:31:46.560 --> 00:31:48.520
we don't really need to do much.

00:31:48.520 --> 00:31:50.960
We are already using all of the data that it has

00:31:50.960 --> 00:31:53.960
in order to ask when is Christmas in America?

00:31:53.960 --> 00:31:57.920
So let's go ahead and do some zero-shot prompting.

00:31:57.920 --> 00:32:02.920
When is Christmas in America?

00:32:03.680 --> 00:32:05.520
And here, go.

00:32:05.520 --> 00:32:10.040
Okay, so it clearly already has the data for this.

00:32:10.040 --> 00:32:13.940
We don't need to add any examples or anything like that.

00:32:13.940 --> 00:32:17.840
So as you can see, zero-shot prompting refers

00:32:17.840 --> 00:32:21.320
to a way of querying models like GPT

00:32:21.320 --> 00:32:23.840
without any explicit training examples

00:32:23.840 --> 00:32:25.760
for the task at hand.

00:32:25.760 --> 00:32:29.680
In the context of machine learning and not just GPT,

00:32:29.680 --> 00:32:33.040
zero-shot typically means that a model performs a task

00:32:33.040 --> 00:32:35.440
without having seen any examples

00:32:35.440 --> 00:32:38.380
of that task during its training.

00:32:38.380 --> 00:32:40.520
Okay, great.

00:32:40.520 --> 00:32:43.440
So now let's look at few-shot prompting.

00:32:43.440 --> 00:32:46.200
So once again, with zero-shot prompting,

00:32:46.200 --> 00:32:49.920
