00:35:05.280 --> 00:35:09.040
Great, AI hallucinations.

00:35:09.040 --> 00:35:10.680
Now we're delving into something

00:35:10.680 --> 00:35:13.840
you probably never thought you'd hear in an AI context

00:35:13.840 --> 00:35:16.460
and that's hallucinations.

00:35:16.460 --> 00:35:19.720
So what exactly are AI hallucinations?

00:35:19.720 --> 00:35:22.280
And no, they're not when your AI assistants

00:35:22.280 --> 00:35:24.840
start seeing unicorns and rainbows.

00:35:24.840 --> 00:35:28.000
It's actually a time that refers to the unusual outputs

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:32.440
that AI models can produce when they misinterpret data.

00:35:32.440 --> 00:35:36.080
A prime example of this is Google's Deep Dream.

00:35:36.080 --> 00:35:38.880
You know, that project that turns pictures of your dog

00:35:38.880 --> 00:35:41.600
into a nightmarish blend of dog faces

00:35:41.600 --> 00:35:44.320
and well, more dog faces.

00:35:44.320 --> 00:35:47.320
Deep Dream is an experiment that visualizes the patterns

00:35:47.320 --> 00:35:49.340
learned by a neural network.

00:35:49.340 --> 00:35:52.680
It is built to over interpret and enhance the patterns

00:35:52.680 --> 00:35:55.200
it sees in an image, or in other words,

00:35:55.200 --> 00:35:58.160
fill in the gaps with images.

00:35:58.160 --> 00:36:00.120
But some of the time those gaps

00:36:00.120 --> 00:36:02.600
can be filled with the wrong thing.

00:36:02.600 --> 00:36:05.440
This is an example of an unusual output

00:36:05.440 --> 00:36:10.280
that AI models can produce when they misinterpret data.

00:36:10.280 --> 00:36:13.840
Now, why do these hallucinations happen, you ask?

00:36:13.840 --> 00:36:16.520
They're trained on a huge amount of data

00:36:16.520 --> 00:36:18.520
and they make sense of new data

00:36:18.520 --> 00:36:20.960
based on what they've seen before.

00:36:20.960 --> 00:36:24.280
Sometimes, however, they make connections that are,

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:26.040
let's call it creative.

00:36:26.040 --> 00:36:29.920
And voila, an AI hallucination occurs.

00:36:29.920 --> 00:36:31.400
Despite their funny results,

00:36:31.400 --> 00:36:34.080
AI hallucinations aren't just entertaining.

00:36:34.080 --> 00:36:36.240
They're also quite enlightening.

00:36:36.240 --> 00:36:38.520
They show us how our AI models interpret

00:36:38.520 --> 00:36:40.400
and understand data.

00:36:40.400 --> 00:36:43.920
It's like a sneak peek into their thought processes.

00:36:43.920 --> 00:36:46.720
This example is actually an AI image hallucination,

00:36:46.720 --> 00:36:49.080
as I thought it would be a fun one to show.

00:36:49.080 --> 00:36:52.840
AI hallucinations can also happen with text models.

00:36:52.840 --> 00:36:55.280
An example of this is us asking a text model

00:36:55.280 --> 00:36:57.040
