It's an array made up of numbers

00:40:34.520 --> 00:40:37.220
and a lot of these numbers, okay?

00:40:37.220 --> 00:40:39.000
So not just these three,

00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:40.480
this does spill out

00:40:40.480 --> 00:40:44.100
and this will be a very, very long array of numbers

00:40:44.100 --> 00:40:46.600
that will give you this semantic meaning

00:40:46.600 --> 00:40:50.200
of whatever text you pass through, okay?

00:40:50.200 --> 00:40:54.540
So please have a go at playing around with this API

00:40:54.540 --> 00:40:57.120
in order to create your own text embeddings

00:40:57.120 --> 00:40:59.600
and compare them against other texts embeddings

00:40:59.600 --> 00:41:02.680
